  <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-eee3ab57-179e-47b5-95e3-6a81d4493f63\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-8c9dc3a0-c8cd-48ce-8c5e-60de468c4607\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-a232a604-2c6f-4610-8d00-c52fbf0797b2\">안녕하세요.</span><span style=\"color:#0078cb;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-6a795d4b-817c-4d7a-acf6-2ec2b99cf9a3\"><b> 승리의 여신: 니케</b></span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-f5dd350a-5c95-4c0d-8033-c7a535be0577\">입니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-6d6a2511-8a21-4198-ad87-567fe9ac880b\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-a637ffa5-f0ce-4098-b4ab-5bdce018e791\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b52ab3b1-acb1-49e4-be29-cbd6ee2adb1f\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-e47d20e9-55f5-4a37-9d90-4c1da45bccaa\">오늘 예정되었던 업데이트 중 변경된 내용을 안내드립니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-8e4c72c3-ddf8-44ec-b9a2-2c81bad3c684\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-abee9ba3-9c55-4d9f-ab3f-484d48cc16f6\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d766da34-28bb-4c91-92ba-cf19bec82a93\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-476d3d90-ba17-42a3-a469-8d264c01a63e\">센티 애장품 스킬 수정은 이번 업데이트에서 제외하기로 결정하였으며,</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b912ed7e-59c5-4698-9f29-80e7b7adcb89\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-3bf2cc6f-bf7d-400c-9de7-90d3474c9a91\">관련 상황과 계획은 추후 개발자 노트를 통해 안내드리겠습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-dfacddf5-a2e1-48af-95ab-3ad1f2e9fb71\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-31ad6339-4c26-4896-918e-9a1d6f2ec00d\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-7ad3c002-9738-45f8-b2d8-0ad61e6c3d27\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-f57da47a-6ca7-45a2-ac1b-086bd2254ba0\">업데이트 변경과 관계없이 스킬 초기화 이벤트는 예정대로 진행되며,</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-01d1a0c6-d8b3-4fe7-99fd-2c5085cff952\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-5e4038c3-38ac-4f1f-b666-cfe4e963942f\">관련 보상을 메일함으로 지급해 드릴 예정입니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-6c2b7812-367d-488d-a095-fcc8a4171bfb\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-95dd9eae-1ffb-423b-99bf-4c8906e70bfb\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4d5486d0-63fb-46e1-b43f-5907a345b455\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-b038e3c7-286c-44f7-819c-35954d2093f1\">갑작스러운 변경으로 지휘관님들께 불편을 드리게 된 점 깊이 사과드리며, </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-c2dc5563-d99c-4c70-90d0-53e34714312e\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-2170eeb0-9622-4467-9348-644147f6b570\">이에 대한 사과의 의미로 아래와 같이 추가 보상을 지급해 드릴 예정이니,</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-eb1f8845-cbd4-4d9a-9536-280b8b598d63\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-4b643259-8292-4cce-b22a-ed0edc9dce6b\">자세한 내용은 아래를 참고해 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d71df3b9-092d-4323-b96c-7f86be873d66\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-569936fe-ca1c-409b-bf52-cc9579bf17da\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-42139c28-b65b-4eae-ae78-54b82b5a95a5\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-8a1c36cd-0ab5-4cfb-adec-858c8e1a8a41\">········································································</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d0f62588-576b-4b81-b57f-32b02b40a596\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-77966063-18bd-4004-bdc3-e97049c1e002\"><b>📢 센티 애장품 스킬 관련 안내</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-00e87e9c-7ae3-4dd1-84b7-56791b8324a2\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-653144a7-7c45-4629-ac57-d71e25bde6fc\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-53a7aa0b-c3d6-42d9-80cb-ea82789d34b0\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-3a8f9998-7832-46fa-b501-584f53d1ecdb\"><b>✔️ 스킬 초기화 이벤트 기간</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9817057c-aa3b-4f4f-8c00-b6fc669879d5\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-f